  "version": "1",
  "text": "I have selected a harmonious workday outfit tailored to your elegant figure and the formal requirements of your office environment. The deep beige wool-blend cardigan from #162·26 layers beautifully over the matching beige sweater, creating a soft, sophisticated silhouette that accentuates your defined waist. This warmth is grounded by the relaxed yet structured palazzo trousers with their distinctive stitch detail, which provide comfort without sacrificing professionalism. The brown ankle boots offer a sturdy foundation for walking through your day, while the vibrant patterned mini-bag adds a necessary touch of personality to keep the look from being too uniform.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Layer the dark beige blazer over the sweater; this combination defines your waistline and elongates your legs.",
    "Keep the deep beige knits on for comfort, but you can remove the blayer as the temperature rises during the day.",
    "Use the bright patterned bag to carry your essentials while adding a pop of color that draws the eye upward toward your face."
  ],
